      },
      "notes": "CREDENTIAL REQUIRED. Adding a lead here does NOT add it to call_allowlist and does NOT verify it with Bolna -- do that separately via the Verified Numbers panel and the Bolna dashboard, or the eligibility gate in WF-02 will block the call."
    },
